Models & Database — Real CI4 Racks

Kategori: CodeIgniter  Minggu 4: Models & Database
Prerequisites: Week 3 — Views & Templates.

Learning Objectives

anti mass-assignment (source: codeigniter.com/user_guide/models/model)
, , , ,  (source: user_guide/models/model)

--Why This Matters (Non-IT)

Without Models, every controller hand-writes raw SQL 10x (1 typo = errors in 10 places). With , 1 rack serves 10 controllers.  stops hackers filling  via forms (like Laravel's ).

--Program: Real CI4 Product Rack

bash
php spark make:model ProductModel
php
// app/Models/ProductModel.php — rack
namespace App\Models;
use CodeIgniter\Model;

class ProductModel extends Model {
  protected $table = 'products';
  protected $primaryKey = 'id';
  protected $allowedFields = ['name', 'price', 'stock']; // ONLY these pass save()!
  protected $returnType = 'array';
}
php
// Controller — use the rack
$model = new \App\Models\ProductModel();

// Read
$data["all"] = $model->findAll();
$data["one"] = $model->find(1);
$data["cheap"] = $model->where('price <', 20000)->findAll();
$data["search"] = $model->like('name', 'rice')->findAll();

// Write (only allowedFields pass!)
$model->save(["name" => "Coffee", "price" => 12000, "isadmin" => 1]); // isadmin REJECTED!

// Delete
